    "title": "Lunch for Yaqeen Institute: Advocacy & Leadership | Awad Law Firm",
    "url": "/community-yaqeen/",
    "category": "Community",
    "description": "Supporting research, advocacy, and faith-based community leadership. Learn about The Awad Law Firm",
    "keywords": "Lunch for Yaqeen Institute: Advocacy & Leadership | Awad Law Firm Lunch for Yaqeen: Advocacy, Leadership, and Standing for Justice Moving Forward With Purpose The Responsibility of Those With a Platform A Message From Shaykh Omar Suleiman Why Events Like This Matter Subscribe to our Newsletter Lunch for Yaqeen Institute: Advocacy & Leadership | Awad Law Firm Home About About Mission & Vision Firm History Ibrahim Awad Team Members Why Choose Us Core Values Community Practice Areas Practice Areas Personal Injury Car Accidents Trucking Accidents Motorcycle Accidents Bicycle Accidents Uber Accidents Lyft Accidents Slip & Fall Medical Malpractice Wrongful Death Results Results Case Studies Video Testimonials Reviews Resources Resources TEDx Talk Legal Education Newsletter Awad Academy Newsletter Contact Search here... Free Consultation Home About Community Lunch for Yaqeen COMMUNITY &bull; ADVOCACY &bull; DALTON, GEORGIA Lunch for Yaqeen: Advocacy, Leadership, and Standing for Justice Awad Law Firm recently participated in a meaningful gathering focused on reflection, advocacy, and the responsibility to stand for justice during difficult times. Moving Forward With Purpose The discussion centered on an important question: how do communities continue moving forward in the midst of humanitarian crises? The answer shared throughout the event was clear: progress requires commitment, courage, and the willingness to speak up when it matters most. The Responsibility of Those With a Platform Participants were reminded that individuals with influence, platforms, and opportunities carry a unique responsibility to use their voices to raise awareness and support meaningful change. Leadership, advocacy, and public engagement all play an important role in addressing injustice and supporting those affected by conflict and hardship. A Message From Shaykh Omar Suleiman During the gathering, Shaykh Omar Suleiman delivered a powerful message encouraging people not to take their influence or position for granted. He emphasized the importance of using one's voice, standing for truth, and continuing to advocate for justice: regardless of how uncomfortable or difficult the moment may feel. Why Events Like This Matter Events like these serve as an important reminder that awareness, leadership, and collective action are essential in shaping a more just and compassionate future. Awad Law Firm is proud to be part of a community that takes that responsibility seriously: and to stand alongside others who refuse to look away. Back to Community NEWSLETTER Subscribe to our Newsletter Subscribe Pages Home About Us Our Attorney Practice Areas Case Studies FAQ Our Services Car Accidents Truck Accidents Motorcycle Accidents Wrongful Death Slip & Fall Personal Injury Marietta personal injury lawyers serving clients across Georgia with focused, relentless advocacy. Contact & Offices Marietta, GA 4076 Ebenezer Rd. Dalton, GA 210 North Glenwood Ave. Phone (706) 890-0000 Email team@theawadlawfirm.com Georgia Injury Lawyers Personal Injury Lawyer Car Accident Lawyer Truck Accident Lawyer Slip and Fall Lawyer Accident Guides What to Do After a Crash Average Settlement in Georgia Comparative Negligence Georgia Injury Deadlines Trust Signals Case Results Client Reviews Video Testimonials Attorney Ibrahim Awad &copy; 2026 Awad Law Firm. All Rights Reserved. Privacy Policy | Terms of Service 706- 890-0000"
